      "evidence": "The code relies on content-type and filename without verifying the extension matches the content.",
      "llm_reasoning": "Even if content-type is checked, an attacker could upload a malicious script with a .png extension if the server configuration is weak.",
      "suggested_fix": "Validate that the file extension matches the allowed MIME types."
